WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.750
[Intro Music]
Hi, I'm Beth from RL Food Testing.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.290
Are you wondering how to get a nutrition label
for your food product?

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:16.620
Well it's easy just give us a call and tell
us about your product.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:21.529
You see, there are two methods approved by
the FDA to produce a nutrition fact panel

00:00:21.529 --> 00:00:27.150
label, they are either laboratory analysis
or data-based software analysis.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:31.270
And depending on your food product, we'll
recommend which method we can use.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:35.910
Now most foods would qualify for data-based
software analysis, which is what we are going

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.430
to talk about in this video.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:44.170
The turnaround time for a data-based software
analysis nutrition fact panel label is 24

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:46.370
Hours same day service.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:49.710
We just simply need three pieces of information.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:55.460
Number one, we need your recipe with as much
information about each ingredient and sub-ingredient

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:58.820
and the amounts for any size batch.

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:02.980
Now it's very important to note, that if you
use any processed foods that you include the

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:07.570
list of ingredients from that package, so
that we can incorporate them into your nutrition

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:09.130
label.

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:14.240
Number two, we need the number of servings
per package and this is usually determined

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.900
by the net weight.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:20.250
And lastly, we need the serving size in grams
or ounces.

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:25.400
Now it might be good to note, for peace of
mind, that your recipes are safe with RL Food

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:26.400
Testing.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:30.340
All of our clients receive a signed copy of
our non-disclosure agreement.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:35.049
Keeping your recipes safe is the upmost priority
to us.

00:01:35.049 --> 00:01:40.010
After we receive your payment, we'll email
you your high resolution files.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:43.720
You can either download and print them or
forward them off to your graphic artist so

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:46.460
that they can incorporate them into your current
food labels.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:50.409
And if you need help with that, we have a
graphic design service.

00:01:50.409 --> 00:01:56.170
Now, if you're planning to sell your product
in retail, don't forget about UPC codes or

00:01:56.170 --> 00:02:01.479
Shelf Life Testing, your retailer will more
than likely require both of these.

00:02:01.479 --> 00:02:05.659
So if you have any questions or ready to place
your order, give us a call or email us.

00:02:05.659 --> 00:02:08.280
We are standing by 7 days a week.

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:09.280
Thank you.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:09.281
[music]

